ace=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> can be used as a definition, and which property\nof <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"U\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D448 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>U</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> makes the check work?</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch04-matrices-of-maps/04-products-and-quotients.html"}